type: dataset
title: "Data Center Atlas"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of data-centre construction worldwide. Each project has a
  dated, authoritative observation of physical construction work no more than 90
  days before a fixed lifecycle reference date (2026-08-20), a sourced location
  with its precision recorded (or, for a listed locator exception, host-estate
  context only), and source records with URLs, licences, retrieval times and
  content hashes. Data updated 2026-10-09: 200 physical sites with 203 projects
  in 46 countries, backed by 925 evidence rows. One project (Digital Edge CGK1)
  has host-estate context only, not a reviewed locator
  (https://kiankyars.github.io/datacenter-atlas/methodology/#locators). Statuses
  are the last observed physical status, not the current status; locators are
  not building footprints; capacity is unknown unless a typed observation
  exists; and the dataset is not a census. Atlas-authored data are licensed CC
  BY 4.0; geometries derived from OpenStreetMap are © OpenStreetMap contributors
  under the ODbL 1.0, and other third-party facts keep their source terms (see
  DATA_LICENSE.md).
